stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> received
  received --> normalized: 解析 / 去重
  normalized --> queued: 事务 outbox
  queued --> running: 获取群锁
  running --> sending: 生成完成
  sending --> sent: iLink 返回 ret=0
  running --> failed: LLM / 工具错误
  sending --> failed: 发送失败
  failed --> queued: 可重试且 attempts < 3
  failed --> dead: 超过重试或不可重试
  sent --> [*]
  dead --> [*]
